{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582876799,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827cfffePFfrjkEfSEl2K2","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5798c04001QNCUTFakLAD7GY","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827cfffePFfrjkEfSEl2K2","messageID":"msg_1d5794df1001RZNCRA071q4ZQi","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2fdc801bf40814a","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"| Standalone `/create:sk-skill` full-create | Full handoff, `standalone` scope (H-only fields omitted) |\n| Standalone `/create:sk-skill` full-update | Full handoff, `standalone` scope |","oldString":"| Standalone `/create:skill` full-create | Full handoff, `standalone` scope (H-only fields omitted) |\n| Standalone `/create:skill` full-update | Full handoff, `standalone` scope |","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md\n@@ -110,10 +110,10 @@\n ## 6. BRANCH SCOPE — WHO RENDERS WHAT\n \n | Branch | Renders |\n | --- | --- |\n-| Standalone `/create:skill` full-create | Full handoff, `standalone` scope (H-only fields omitted) |\n-| Standalone `/create:skill` full-update | Full handoff, `standalone` scope |\n+| Standalone `/create:sk-skill` full-create | Full handoff, `standalone` scope (H-only fields omitted) |\n+| Standalone `/create:sk-skill` full-update | Full handoff, `standalone` scope |\n | Parent `/create:skill-parent` create | Full handoff, H-specific values (`leaf-manifest.json` freshness from the scoped generator this workflow just ran) |\n | Parent `/create:skill-parent` update | Full handoff, H-specific values |\n | Reference-only / asset-only create branches | **Not** the full handoff — only the narrow conditional `node .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs --check <skillDir>` leaf-freshness signal, gated on the changed path falling under a configured leaf root |\n | `/doctor:skill-advisor tune` | Full handoff vocabulary, live values from `skill_graph_validate`/`advisor_rebuild`/`advisor_validate` |\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"| Standalone `/create:sk-skill` full-create | Full handoff, `standalone` scope (H-only fields omitted) |\\n| Standalone `/create:sk-skill` full-update | Full handoff, `standalone` scope |\", \"oldString\": \"| Standalone `/create:skill` full-create | Full handoff, `standalone` scope (H-only fields omitted) |\\n| Standalone `/create:skill` full-update | Full handoff, `standalone` scope |\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/shared/advisor-index-handoff.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582875140,"end":1794582876799}}}}
