on-workflow.md) and [parent-skills-nested-packets.md](../parent-skill/parent-skills-nested-packets.md)\n - You are only scoring or editing prose in an existing skill. Use `create-quality-control`\n - You are tempted to convert framework-internal skills (`sk-doc`, `system-spec-kit`, `system-deep-loop`, and peers). Leave those alone\n \n **Key Sources**:\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/skill/upgrading-a-skill-to-v4.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"- You are creating a brand-new skill from scratch. Use `/create:sk-skill` or `/create:skill-parent` directly.\", \"oldString\": \"- You are creating a brand-new skill from scratch. Use `/create:skill` or `/create:skill-parent` directly.\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/references/skill/upgrading-a-skill-to-v4.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582881862,"end":1794582890722}}}}
